0.409	step	node tools/image_gate.mjs --test 	The image gate refuses to close a building that does not match its pictures (T-2368)
0.959	step	node tools/test_prebuilt_index.mjs 	The page asks only for the prebuilt layers publish listed: a year with no prebuild makes no 404 request (dev mobile smoke fix)
0.482	step	node tools/check_window_mode.mjs 	Window mode sets a phone or iPad down where it stands and turns with it: the datum projection, the compass, the GPS hysteresis (T-3577)
0.199	step	node tools/test_blackbox.mjs 	The black box keeps the page's last steps in local storage, and the next page shows a cut-off page's on the crash card (T-2826)
0.308	step	node tools/test_arrival.mjs 	Arrival year pacing stays monotone, bounded and readiness-honest (T-1247)
0.240	step	node tools/test_work_day_source.mjs 	1812 visible work follows real normalized primary day jobs and historical presence (T-3551)
0.252	step	node tools/test_recall.mjs 	The way home: All destinations and Recall ask first, Cancel/Esc stay put, Return runs the reverse ring and stamps the trip, reduced motion skips the ring (T-2735)
0.194	step	node tools/test_viewport_accessibility.mjs 	Browser magnification preserves viewport size and independent movement and look controls (T-3658)
0.536	step	node tools/test_selected_year.mjs 	Selected-year arrival and catalog isolation (T-1767)
7.979	step	node tools/check_far_slot_field.mjs 	The far band's slot field asks every far slot at the slot itself (T-2967)
0.236	step	node tools/test_person_interactions.mjs 	Walking people keep their Interact menu, explicit picks persist, and dismissal releases them (T-3543)
23.097	step	python3 tools/test_human_lady_1904.py 	A 1904 lady's day dress is sourced, layered and skinned on the shared rig (T-3447)
1.537	step	python3 tools/test_human_source_normals.py 	Resident body normals share exact source seams without welding geometry or UVs (T-1789)
2.506	step	python3 tools/test_standing_horse_anatomy_v2.py 	Selected horse anatomy reproduces the authored source and protects rig, eye maps and skin ancestry (T-3088)
0.401	step	node tools/test_human_camera_fit.mjs 	Resident inspection camera fits geometry below the header without moving the subject
0.484	step	node tools/lay_driven_wagons_1835.mjs --check 	The 1835 town's ten wagons' rows are what their layer writes: one district each, their teamsters, stops and hours (T-3558)
0.342	step	python3 docs/RESEARCH/people-1812-3462/place.py --check 	The 1812 garrison's instance records are what place.py writes (T-3462, T-3490)
1.328	step	node tools/test_town_people_1871.mjs 	1871's people stand on the context city's walks at their own doors, most out on the Sunday afternoon, and each wagon is led by its carded driver (T-3690)
35.070	selftest	node tools/check_jaunt_views.mjs --self-test 	The jaunt-view gate sees a stop behind a trunk when the stand-off rule is not told of the trees (T-3263)
0.296	step	node tools/test_fabric.mjs 	A driver's plain garments read as cloth: weave, heather and sheen by shader patch, no texture, one program (T-2804)
1.869	step	node tools/test_photo_face_deployment.mjs 	Default photo faces cover every year and child proportions survive the shared photographic style (T-3767, T-3768)
3.803	step	node tools/test_board_climb.mjs 	Climb up and get down are drawn: the year's figure walks over, climbs by the hub and the rail and sits, its holds on the real vehicles, both sides, the eye watching (T-3560)
